{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55990","headline":"赠剑客 · 黄损","name":"赠剑客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杯酒会云林，扶邦志亦深。\n晶莹三尺剑，决烈一生心。\n见死寻常事，闻冤即往寻。\n荆轲不了处，扼腕到如今。\n（周本淳校本《诗话总龟》卷二八引《雅言系述》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄损","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55990.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55990","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}